    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Glendora, nicknamed “The Pride of the Foothills,” rests at the base of the San Gabriel Mountains along historic Route 66.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofglendora.gov/Explore/About-Glendora"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Glendora Historical Society, founded in 1947, protects landmarks like Rubel Castle and the Glendora Museum.",
